  <span>&#8226; <%= link_to "Quick Start for GitHub Copilot", "https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/get-started/quickstart" %></span><br>
  <span>&#8226; <%= link_to "About GitHub Advanced Security", "https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/learning-about-github/about-github-advanced-security" %></span><br>
  <span>&#8226; <%= link_to "Viewing your usage of metered products", "https://docs.github.com/en/billing/how-tos/products/view-productlicense-use" %></span><br>
</p>

<p style="text-align: start;">
  Additionally, we recommend leveraging our <%= link_to "Copilot-powered support", "https://support.github.com/success/copilot" %> for real-time assistance. If you have any questions, feel free to contact us at <a href="mailto:startups@github.com">startups@github.com</a>.
</p>

<p style="text-align: start;">
  We're thrilled to have you in the program, let's build from here!
</p>

<p style="text-align: start;">
